# Balebos ignore file
# Each line represents an asset pattern to ignore
# Empty lines and lines starting with # are ignored

# ----- Example Configuration -----

# Exact matches by domain name
test.example.com
staging.example.org

# Glob patterns (wildcard matching)
*.dev.*
*.staging.*
*.test.*
*-temp.*

# System-generated patterns
www*.cdn-*

# ----- Usage Instructions -----
# 1. Copy this file to "balebos.ignore" to activate
# 2. Customize the patterns to match your environment
# 3. Run balebos commands to see filtered results
#
# Note: Ignoring only affects display of results;
# all data continues to be stored for future reference.